# The image resolves these by name through dlsym. Link-time optimisation
# internalises anything nothing references, and nothing in Swift calls them,
# so name them here or they vanish from a release build.
_luma_*
# The bridge the image calls back through as it boots. Missing it, the image
# comes up without SwiftyPharo and nothing Pharo answers.
_swifty_pharo_*
